    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the night shift.</strong><br>You're the only one left behind the counter at Greasez\u2019s, a rundown 24-hour burger joint. The fryers are hot, the orders keep coming in\u2026 but something isn\u2019t right. You're not alone. And closing time may never come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Late Hours</strong> is a first-person horror experience that blends psychological tension with immersive storytelling. Play as Dylan or Rachel, an employee stuck working a late-night shift while their personal life falls apart \u2014 and something far worse begins to unfold in the shadows of the restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A grounded horror narrative</strong> centered on a crumbling relationship, a dead-end job, and a masked killer with a history tied to this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person, story-driven gameplay</strong> with no jump-scare spam \u2014 just raw atmosphere, dread, and consequence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/c7c9ef63dfe73c3bea77d93772d6a5fe.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/c7c9ef63dfe73c3bea77d93772d6a5fe.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic shift simulation</strong> \u2014 take orders, prep burgers, and clean up\u2026 while slowly realizing the nightmare you're in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/fb12dbfebe98bc009956f2f04024d1d9.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/fb12dbfebe98bc009956f2f04024d1d9.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/4bfef262c94394444e9614fa1fdccf84.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/4bfef262c94394444e9614fa1fdccf84.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/38b7bcb7ed32ac2ea6223ed18829c5c9.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/38b7bcb7ed32ac2ea6223ed18829c5c9.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/64cc62a6d0bee16b93961c4ec33996e3.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/64cc62a6d0bee16b93961c4ec33996e3.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic phone system</strong> \u2014 receive texts from your partner throughout the night. Your choices in how you respond could save or end the relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> based on your actions, timing, and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your job. Don\u2019t look behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greasez\u2019s is open all night.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the night shift.</strong><br>You're the only one left behind the counter at Greasez\u2019s, a rundown 24-hour burger joint. The fryers are hot, the orders keep coming in\u2026 but something isn\u2019t right. You're not alone. And closing time may never come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Late Hours</strong> is a first-person horror experience that blends psychological tension with immersive storytelling. Play as Dylan or Rachel, an employee stuck working a late-night shift while their personal life falls apart \u2014 and something far worse begins to unfold in the shadows of the restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A grounded horror narrative</strong> centered on a crumbling relationship, a dead-end job, and a masked killer with a history tied to this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person, story-driven gameplay</strong> with no jump-scare spam \u2014 just raw atmosphere, dread, and consequence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/c7c9ef63dfe73c3bea77d93772d6a5fe.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/c7c9ef63dfe73c3bea77d93772d6a5fe.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic shift simulation</strong> \u2014 take orders, prep burgers, and clean up\u2026 while slowly realizing the nightmare you're in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/fb12dbfebe98bc009956f2f04024d1d9.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/fb12dbfebe98bc009956f2f04024d1d9.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/4bfef262c94394444e9614fa1fdccf84.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/4bfef262c94394444e9614fa1fdccf84.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/38b7bcb7ed32ac2ea6223ed18829c5c9.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/38b7bcb7ed32ac2ea6223ed18829c5c9.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/64cc62a6d0bee16b93961c4ec33996e3.poster.avif?t=1748028110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743850/extras/64cc62a6d0bee16b93961c4ec33996e3.webm?t=1748028110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic phone system</strong> \u2014 receive texts from your partner throughout the night. Your choices in how you respond could save or end the relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> based on your actions, timing, and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your job. Don\u2019t look behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greasez\u2019s is open all night.</strong></p>",
